# The pinned DevPod release (ADR 0021).
#
# build/scripts/51-devpod.sh downloads exactly this version and refuses to
# continue unless the artefact matches DEVPOD_DEB_SHA256. Both values are
# rewritten together by:
#
#     scripts/maintenance/update-devpod.sh
#
# Do not edit the checksum by hand. A version bumped without its checksum fails
# the build, which is the intended behaviour.
#
# 0.6.15 is upstream's newest STABLE release and it is old: 2025-03-10, with
# nothing but v0.7.0-alpha prereleases since and no commit to the repository
# since 2025-11-14. It is still nine months newer than the end-of-life Flathub
# build it replaces (0.6.10, 2024-01-21), which is why this is an improvement
# rather than a fix. If upstream is genuinely finished, the right move is to
# drop DevPod rather than to pin it forever — see the ADR.
#
# Upstream: https://github.com/loft-sh/devpod/releases
DEVPOD_VERSION=0.6.15
DEVPOD_DEB_SHA256=e4cf9872550679b9fc9532b480dfa3d9f0281a290d24fdc943bf181a9a846fa3
